    <h1>CAR-T Cell Therapy in China</h1>
    <p>China's NMPA has approved seven CAR-T therapies — more than the United States or Europe — including satri-cel, the world's first CAR-T approved for a solid tumor. For patients whose cancer has come back after standard treatment, this page covers who qualifies, what it actually costs, and what the evidence really shows.</p>
