    </div>
</header>

<main class="ct-shell">

    <section id="am-i-eligible">
        <h2 class="ct-section-title">Is this page for you?</h2>
        <p class="ct-section-sub">Tick everything that applies. CAR-T is only an option for certain cancers and certain targets — if several of these apply, a free case review can tell you whether you actually qualify and at which hospital.</p>
        <div class="ct-check" id="ctCheck">
            <div class="ct-check-item"><input type="checkbox" id="k1"><label for="k1">My cancer has come back or stopped responding after at least two lines of treatment</label></div>
