            <div class="ct-check-item"><input type="checkbox" id="k3"><label for="k3">I have multiple myeloma that has relapsed after several lines of therapy</label></div>
            <div class="ct-check-item"><input type="checkbox" id="k4"><label for="k4">I have gastric or gastroesophageal junction cancer that tested Claudin18.2-positive</label></div>
            <div class="ct-check-item"><input type="checkbox" id="k5"><label for="k5">My doctors have told me standard treatment options are running out</label></div>
            <div class="ct-check-item"><input type="checkbox" id="k6"><label for="k6">I am well enough for intensive treatment (ECOG 0–1)</label></div>
